<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>This <ref refid="classWebsocketServer" kindref="compound">WebsocketServer</ref> class provides abstraction to a generic websocket server that allows a common interface regardless of whether hdtn is compiled with boost::beast or CivetWeb. </para>
</sect1>
